{"ID":"20240118145022-uxzfus8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145022-uxzfus8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145022-uxzfus8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145022-0ef2yog\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122155941-5omm2hx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122155941-5omm2hx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:415,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:415\u0026#125;","title":"299鬼臼300羊桃301女青","type":"doc","updated":"20240204111146"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145022-0ef2yog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145022-0ef2yog","updated":"20240122155916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鬼臼"}]},{"ID":"20240122155916-3poiwl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122155916-3poiwl2","updated":"20240122155920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，有毒。主杀蛊毒，鬼疰，精物，辟恶气不详。逐邪，解百毒。生山谷。一名爵犀，一名马目毒公，一名九臼。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122155921-xd89yvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122155921-xd89yvn","updated":"20240122155924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"羊桃"}]},{"ID":"20240122155924-i30k7br","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122155924-i30k7br","updated":"20240122155929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，有毒。治熛热，身暴赤色，风水，积聚，恶疡，除小儿热，生山林川谷及田野。一名鬼桃，一名羊肠。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122155929-a5hb09w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122155929-a5hb09w","updated":"20240122155936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"女青"}]},{"ID":"20240122155934-7atxb2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122155934-7atxb2v","updated":"20240122155940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，平，有毒．治蛊毒，逐邪恶气，杀鬼，温疟，辟不祥，生山谷。一名雀瓢。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122155940-6cxmlpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122155940-6cxmlpn"}},{"ID":"20240122155941-5omm2hx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122155941-5omm2hx","updated":"20240204111146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二九九、三○○、三○一，这些什么鬼臼啊，羊桃啊，女青，这种都是已经失去很（久），采药的人已经认不得了，那有这些药肯定是在那边，有待以后我们去发掘，张仲景也没有用它，那有没有效？我相信一定有效，因为它列在本草经里，那一定有效。这个要花时间去挖掘出来，以后还要临床的使用，哦，能够看到。。。因为本草经写的东西的时候，他有很多东西他很雷同，有没有？我们真正去看到实物的时候，一看就知道这药的功能在哪里，它怎么长的怎么看得出，一吃就知道了，所以说如果这些药经过我们来吃，我们来写就不一样了，你看唐容川写的就不一样了，对不对？哦，那药征，这东洞吉益，很厉害哦，他是硬背硬记，这药就这样用，所以他把它简化了，简单嘛，那他的药性并没有象唐容川，唐容川刚好是四川人，对不对？中国的药8%是产在四川，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四川是中药的最大集散地"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对啊，那中药很好，你看熊猫多温驯，对不对？你看熊猫就那么温驯，你就知道中药一定很好的，哦，连熊都那么温驯。"}]}]}